scripts=[('The brief is the starting point','Before I ask AI for captions, I collect services, hours, a booking link and approved photos. Without these, the output can invent business details. Here is the filled practice brief. Next I turn the facts into a calendar.'),('A calendar with a job for every post','Seven posts should not repeat the same sales line. Here is a service question, a preparation FAQ, a process post and a clear inquiry CTA. Each row says what the post does and which visual it needs. This is a fictional example.'),('Edit the generic draft','AI wrote “world-class braids, book before slots disappear.” The brief supports neither claim. I replaced it with a consultation question and a useful next step. Here is the before and after. That check is part of the delivery.'),('Show the complete handoff','This is what I would hand a salon owner: brief, calendar, seven captions, three layouts, and instructions. The owner knows which file to use and how to request a revision. The pack is a demonstration, not a client earnings story.'),('Start without a video subscription','I recorded my screen, used my own voice, and made the layouts from free assets. Stock footage can support the story when licensed. A paid scene generator is optional. Finish a useful sample before adding a subscription.'),('Choose your income route','Services mean adapting a deliverable to a client brief. Products mean creating a reusable solution a buyer can use themselves. Here the diagnostic saves the route, and the workbench shows the next task. Choose the work you can deliver.'),('What the Blueprint actually includes','The Blueprint connects ten playbooks with worked examples, free and paid tool routes, saved tasks, and fifty focused prompts. Here is one full delivery. It is $97 one-time if that matches the checkout. You can inspect the preview before deciding; income is not guaranteed.')]
(A/'seven-video-scripts.txt').write_text('\n\n'.join(f'VIDEO {i}: {title}\n0-3s: show the relevant file and title.\n3-24s: {body}\n24-32s: show one exact output, then say “Ask for SALON if you want the filled preview.” Deliver manually when requested.\nFootage: {title.lower()} screen detail + cursor action + phone-size output preview.\nReview: replace practice details, verify offer price/link, no earnings screenshot or invented result.' for i,(title,body) in enumerate(scripts,1)))
